=<span style=\"color:#009100\">&quot;local&quot;</span>, sparkEnvir=list(SPARK_USER=<span style=\"color:#009100\">&quot;tester&quot;</span>)\r\n</pre> \r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div> \r\n                                        </td> \r\n                                    </tr> \r\n                                </table> \r\n                            </td> \r\n                        </tr></table></td></tr></table></div>"
